# Written by hand (ADR 0051): undo and redo while cars drive. A street crossing the town is
# undone and redone, a bulldozed street is brought back, a curve chain is undone and redone
# as one step, a class change is undone in place, and a station, pump and line are undone
# and redone. The halfway save and load falls between steps, so history is saved too.
sim-game command log 1
seed 3
map 12 12
0 road 0 0 600 0 main
0 road 0 0 0 400 street
0 road 600 0 600 400 street
0 road 0 400 600 400 street
0 road 300 0 300 400 street
10 fill 150 200 residential-low
10 fill 450 200 commercial-low
20 spawn 80
400 road 600 200 900 200 street
600 undo
800 redo
900 delete 300 300
1000 undo
1100 curve 600 400 700 500 800 400 street
1101 curve 800 400 900 300 1000 400 street chain
1200 undo
1300 class 150 400 main
1400 undo
1450 redo
1500 station 540 430
1510 water 400 430 pump
1520 line 150 520 150 700
1700 undo
1700 undo
1800 redo
2000 undo
2000 undo
2000 undo
2200 redo
2200 redo
2400 redo
end 3000
